1
00:00:00,146 --> 00:00:04,149
What if your customers could update their
support tickets with a single click, right

2
00:00:04,149 --> 00:00:04,816
from an email?

3
00:00:04,896 --> 00:00:09,115
That's Klick-Zen. Let's look at what it
is, and how it works.

4
00:00:09,195 --> 00:00:13,987
Klick-Zen is an app for Zendesk that adds
one-click action buttons to your emails,

5
00:00:13,987 --> 00:00:15,798
agent replies, and Help Center.

6
00:00:15,878 --> 00:00:20,676
Each button does something useful to the
ticket. Confirm it's resolved, route it to

7
00:00:20,676 --> 00:00:22,815
the right team, or approve a request.

8
00:00:22,895 --> 00:00:28,199
No login, no reply, and no trip to your
support portal. Just one click.

9
00:00:28,279 --> 00:00:34,248
You build buttons right inside Zendesk.
Choose the words, colors and style to

10
00:00:34,248 --> 00:00:35,566
match your brand.

11
00:00:35,646 --> 00:00:42,270
Then pick what it does when clicked: set
the status, add a tag, post a comment, and

12
00:00:42,270 --> 00:00:46,100
more. One button can do several actions at
once.

13
00:00:46,180 --> 00:00:50,689
When it's ready, click Create, and
Klick-Zen gives you a small snippet to

14
00:00:50,689 --> 00:00:50,998
copy.

15
00:00:51,078 --> 00:00:55,388
Paste it into a trigger, automation or
macro, or drop a button straight into a

16
00:00:55,388 --> 00:00:56,991
reply from the ticket editor.

17
00:00:57,071 --> 00:01:01,841
Zendesk fills in the ticket details on
every email, so each button knows exactly

18
00:01:01,841 --> 00:01:03,451
which ticket it belongs to.

19
00:01:03,531 --> 00:01:08,000
Here's what your customer receives: a
friendly message, and one clear button.

20
00:01:08,080 --> 00:01:12,299
When they click, Klick-Zen applies the
actions you chose to their ticket, through

21
00:01:12,299 --> 00:01:14,279
its secure connection to your Zendesk.

22
00:01:14,359 --> 00:01:18,475
It's a normal ticket update, so your
triggers and automations react just as

23
00:01:18,475 --> 00:01:20,231
they would to an agent's change.

24
00:01:20,311 --> 00:01:25,472
Your customer lands on a confirmation page
with your logo, colors and message, hosted

25
00:01:25,472 --> 00:01:26,261
by Klick-Zen.

26
00:01:26,341 --> 00:01:31,419
And back in Zendesk, the ticket is already
solved, with nothing left for your agents

27
00:01:31,419 --> 00:01:31,782
to do.

28
00:01:31,862 --> 00:01:37,500
Is it safe? Yes. Each link works only for
its own ticket, and a click can only do

29
00:01:37,500 --> 00:01:38,614
what you set up.

30
00:01:38,694 --> 00:01:43,163
Customers never need to log in, and
automated email scanners can't set a

31
00:01:43,163 --> 00:01:44,590
button off by accident.

32
00:01:44,670 --> 00:01:49,421
Faster resolutions, cleaner ticket data,
and a customer experience that feels

33
00:01:49,421 --> 00:01:50,100
effortless.

34
00:01:50,180 --> 00:01:54,909
Find Klick-Zen on the Zendesk Marketplace,
and give your customers a one-click way to

35
00:01:54,909 --> 00:01:55,799
get things done.
